<section class="section alt">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="panel highlight reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">What sets Access apart?</h2>
      <p class="subhead">Home care is more than just scheduling a caregiver in the home. Every individual is different, each with their own set of unique needs.</p>
      <p class="subhead">When developing a care plan, it is important for family and loved ones to be a part of its development. I have found that home care becomes excellent when there's a team approach, with dedicated home care managers working with you, the family, and/or a loved one. We strive to develop and implement a home care program tailored to an individualâ€™s needs that encourages independence, home safety, and well-being in all aspects of care.</p>
      <p class="subhead">We specialize in helping folks just like you and your loved ones live in the comfort and safety of their home with the love and support they need.</p>
  <div>
  <div class="card feature-card">
    <div class="feature-head">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"
            d="M12.8242 2.19551C12.2855 2.0416 11.7145 2.0416 11.1758 2.19551L6.17584 3.62408C4.88793 3.99205 4 5.16921 4 6.50865V11.8831C4 14.7897 5.40369 17.5173 7.76886 19.2067L10.2563 20.9834C11.2994 21.7285 12.7006 21.7285 13.7437 20.9834L16.2311 19.2067C18.5963 17.5173 20 14.7897 20 11.8831V6.50865C20 5.16921 19.1121 3.99205 17.8242 3.62408L12.8242 2.19551Z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Safety-minded care</h3>
    </div>
    <p>We prioritize fall-risk awareness, routines, and respectful support.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card feature-card">
    <div class="feature-head">
      <div class="icon" style="padding: 0 10.5px;">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 19 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M1.24264 8.24264L8 15L14.7574 8.24264C15.553 7.44699 16 6.36786 16 5.24264V5.05234C16 2.8143 14.1857 1 11.9477 1C10.7166 1 9.55233 1.55959 8.78331 2.52086L8 3.5L7.21669 2.52086C6.44767 1.55959 5.28338 1 4.05234 1C1.8143 1 0 2.8143 0 5.05234V5.24264C0 6.36786 0.44699 7.44699 1.24264 8.24264Z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Compassion first</h3>
    </div>
    <p>Kindness, patience, and dignity are non-negotiable.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card feature-card">
    <div class="feature-head">
      <div class="icon">
