      <h3>Personalized plans</h3>
    </div>
    <p>We match care to needs â€” and adjust as health changes.</p>
  </div>

</div>

    </div>

    <div class="panel reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">Getting started is simple</h2>
      <p class="subhead">A clear, low-stress process from first call to first day of care. Our team guides you through each step with clarity, compassion, and no pressure to rush decisions. 
	  From your first conversation with a care coordinator to the moment support begins in your home, we handle the details so you can move forward with confidence, knowing support is in place and adaptable as life changes.</p>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px">

        <!-- STEP 1 -->
        <div class="card soft step-card">
          <div class="step-media">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/caretakeronphone.jpg"
              alt="Care coordinator smiling while talking on the phone"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <div class="meta"><span style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:900">1</span><span>â€¢</span><span>Talk with us</span></div>
            <h3>Contact us</h3>
            <p>Share your situation â€” schedule a free in-home assessment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 2 -->
        <div class="card soft step-card">
          <div class="step-media">
            <img
