         <article class="review-card" data-review-source="testimonial">
<p class="review-quote">â€œAccess Home Care -it has been a true pleasure working with them. Every time I call them with a potential family that needs assistance, they reach out to them immediately and then report back to me how it went. Thank you for always being so communicative and speedy with the seniors and their families that need the assistance.â€</p>
